// Article 4. Child support.
#require "1-schedule.charter".
Role payer For parent Is Daniel
Role payee For parent Is Rosa
Param support = $650.00
Act pay-support Actor payer Recipient payee Related to int, amount : USD
  Holds when True
  Valid when amount == support
Duty support-due Holder payer Claimant payee
  Every 30 days
  Due within 5 days Grace 3 days
  Paid by pay-support

Clause 4.1 => payer, payee, support, support-due, pay-support
Clause 4.2 => support-due.
